  :title "ADR-2607031500: kotoba-lang/youtube-upload — extract yukkuri's YouTube client into a shared lib"
  :status "accepted"
  :date "2026-07-03"
  :deciders ["Jun Kawasaki"]
  :doc_type "adr"
  :topic "kotoba-lang-youtube-upload-extraction"
  :authoritative true
  :authoritative_for
  ["new repo kotoba-lang/youtube-upload (public) holds four pure async
    functions extracted from ai-gftd-project-yukkuri's upload_youtube.py:
    refresh_access_token, upload_video, upload_caption, set_thumbnail —
    no D1/yukkuri dependency, raw httpx, no googleapiclient"
   "every non-2xx response raises YouTubeUploadError(stage, status_code,
    detail); callers decide fatal vs non-fatal per call"
   "credential resolution (per-channel token isolation), video-byte
    fetching, and result persistence stay in the caller (yukkuri) — this
    library only talks to Google's endpoints"
   "deliberate exception to the kotoba-lang .cljc convention: implemented
    in Python because it runs inside yukkuri's Python LangGraph k8s pod;
    a Clojure port would force an RPC/subprocess bridge for a stateless
    HTTP client, which is disproportionate ceremony"
   "registered via manifest/repos.edn :extra-projects → bb
    scripts/gen-west-manifest.bb --entry workflow"]
